OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency housing demand has
OL,4,Adoubled says charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe need for emergency accommodation in
OL,7,Fa county has more than doubled over the
OL,8,Fpast five years, according to a youth
OL,9,Fcharity.
OL,11,FYMCA Cheltenham, which supports people
OL,12,Facross Gloucestershire, said it has
OL,13,Fprovided more than 100,000 nights of
OL,14,Femergency accommodation in the last 12
OL,15,Fmonths, compared to 47,000 nights in
OL,16,F2021.
OL,18,FRob Charsley, head of communities,
OL,19,Fhealth and wellbeing at the charity,
OL,20,Fsaid the rise in demand was due to a
OL,21,Frange of factors.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
