OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency housing demand has
OL,4,Adoubled says charity
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We've seen increased financial
OL,7,Fpressures, problems with mental health,
OL,8,Fphysical health, addiction and
OL,9,Fsubstance misuse. It's not unique to
OL,10,FGloucestershire, but something we're
OL,11,Fseeing across the country," he said.
